                  <body>Per-field physical mapping linking a variable measured by a distribution to its physical representation in the file - column index, format, physical data type, number pattern, null sequence, etc. (cdif:hasPhysicalMapping items). TextMapping and LocatorMapping specialize it for text-tabular and structured (locator) data respectively.</body>
