                  <annotatedElement xmi:idref="CDIFDataDescription.Reference"/>
                  <body>A typed reference to an external entity (cdif:Reference). Provides a labeled link surface (name, description, url) plus the DDI-CDI dt-Reference semantics (uri, optional cdif:semantic describing the role). See the cdifProperties/cdifReference building block for the full definition; this is the per-profile UML class that JSON-shape unions reduce to.</body>
